mages/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n<p> &nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/scoreboard objectives add _ dummy</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/scoreboard players set @s _ 16777216</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/execute <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> predicate _</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> → <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> <tt>Test passed</tt></p></li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/scoreboard players set @s _ 16777217</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/execute <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> predicate _</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> → <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> <tt>Test passed</tt></p></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>&nbsp;<tt>data/minecraft/predicates/_.json</tt>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">{\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"condition\"</span>:&nbsp;<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:entity_scores\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"code-quote\">\"scores\"</span>:&nbsp;{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp